            "⚠️ Except for these five, which you should learn right now because they're so common: **אֶרֶץ** (land), **עִיר** (city), **דֶּרֶךְ** (way, road), **אֶבֶן** (stone), and **רוּחַ** (wind) are all **feminine** even though they don't end in ־ָה."
          ]
